<p class="crawl-episode" lang="en">EXPERIMENT 04</p>
<h2 lang="en">A NEW HOPE</h2>
<p lang="en">It is a time when stories are fading from the Web galaxy. Countless pages, in pursuit of speed and efficiency, have slowly assumed the same form.</p>
<p lang="en">In a remote corner of the galaxy, a small page carrying the memory of a forgotten film awakens.</p>
<p lang="en">Passed down across distant stars, the story is now entrusted to the fingertips of a lone viewer. This journey may bring wonder back to the Web and become a new hope....</p>
